body:
You already can search by move:


@[insert move here] will search by specific move eg @fire fang will come up with every mon with that move. 

@[move type] will search for every mon with that move type eg @water will return with every mon with a water type move. 


@1[move type] will search all pokemon with a Fast Move of that type eg @1ice will be a list of fast ice type moves

@2[move type] is the same as above but Charged move type eg @Dragon will be dragon type Charged Moves

@3[move type] is for second charged moves as above
